    <p>Always discuss supplements with your clinician before starting them. Some supplements may interact with medications or may not be appropriate for your specific situation.</p>

    <h2>When to Call Your Clinician</h2>

    <p>Contact your healthcare provider immediately if you experience:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Heavy vaginal bleeding (soaking a pad in an hour)</li>
      <li>Severe abdominal pain or cramping</li>
      <li>Fever over 100.4°F (38°C)</li>
      <li>Severe vomiting (cannot keep liquids down)</li>
      <li>Pain or burning during urination</li>
      <li>Sudden swelling of hands, face, or eyes</li>
    </ul>

